<LanguageData>
    <!-- Mugirl Milk -->
    <Mugirl_Milk.label>雪牛奶</Mugirl_Milk.label>
    <!-- The milk secreted by Mugirls is sweet and rich, with a milky white hue and a light blue sheen. Miracle Star Genetic Engineering has endowed it with nutritional content far surpassing ordinary milk. When added to meals, it significantly boosts immunity and promotes rapid wound healing. -->
    <Mugirl_Milk.description>雪牛娘分泌的乳汁，香甜浓郁，呈乳白带淡蓝色光泽。奇迹星基因工程让其营养成分远超普通牛奶，添加到食物中可以大幅提升免疫力，并促进伤口快速愈合。</Mugirl_Milk.description>
    <!-- Mugirl Fur -->
    <Mugirl_Wool.label>雪牛娘毛</Mugirl_Wool.label>
    <!-- A by-product of the Miracle Star Genetic Engineering programme- the fur of Mugirls, possessing the same light blue colour as Muffalo fur but significantly softer in texture. When sniffed closely, it carries a faint buttery scent. -->
    <Mugirl_Wool.description>奇迹星基因工程的副产物之一——雪牛娘的毛发，雪牛一样的淡蓝色，但在质感上远比雪牛毛更柔软。细细嗅闻能闻到淡淡的牛油味。</Mugirl_Wool.description>
</LanguageData>
